      "html": "<p>Wild forms of livebearers are only rarely kept continuously by hobbyists over decades. Poecilia melanogaster is one of these species.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "beforeYouBuy",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/18-toothcarps-killis-and-livebearers/poecilia_limia_melanogaster_en/",
      "html": "<p>It originates from Jamaica, but only bred ones are available from time to time. P. melanogaster can be found only occasionally in pet shops: if it appears there, it will soon be sold again.</p>"
    },
    {
